{"v":1,"id":"maybe-was-the-answer","title":"Maybe Was The Answer","duration":150.62,"envHz":12.5,"identity":{"bpm":129,"bpmExact":129.2,"key":"F#","mode":"minor","keyConf":0.79,"genre":"Afro-fusion","subGenres":["R&B","Hip-hop"],"mood":"confident, playful, ominous, haunted","energy":"medium","language":"English","vocalStyle":"confident conversational with smooth harmonies","styleSentence":"A mid-tempo (129 bpm) Afro-fusion track blending smooth R&B harmonies with hip-hop swagger and distorted sub-bass, evolving from a bright, layered chorus into a sparse, reverb-drenched bridge that emphasizes the tension between playful confidence and underlying threat.","summary":"The song chronicles a relationship reversal where a former pursuer becomes obsessed after being rejected, shifting from playful confidence to an ominous warning about setting boundaries. It explores themes of power dynamics, the volatility of love, and the eerie persistence of someone who knows too much.","themes":["Power Dynamics","Obsession vs. Safety","Relationship Reversal","Eerie Persistence"],"keywords":[{"word":"confident","emotion":"Empowered and amused","imageryPrompt":"A silhouette standing tall under a streetlamp at night, posture relaxed but firm, glowing with an inner golden light that pushes back shadows."},{"word":"haunted","emotion":"Uneasy and vigilant","imageryPrompt":"Faint, ghostly footprints trailing behind a figure in a dark alleyway, the air shimmering with cold mist where they walked hours ago."},{"word":"playful","emotion":"Light-hearted but sharp-edged","imageryPrompt":"A cat sitting on a windowsill watching rain streak glass, tail twitching rhythmically while ignoring the storm outside."},{"word":"ominous","emotion":"Threatening and heavy","imageryPrompt":"Car headlights cutting through thick fog in an empty parking lot, casting long, distorted shadows that seem to move independently of objects."},{"word":"warning","emotion":"Serious and final","imageryPrompt":"A red neon sign flickering against a brick wall, casting stark warnings on the pavement where wet footprints are being erased by rain."},{"word":"obsession","emotion":"Intense and suffocating","imageryPrompt":"Dozens of identical phone notifications stacking up like a tower blocking out sunlight, creating an impenetrable wall of digital noise."},{"word":"maybe","emotion":"uncertainty turning into regret","imageryPrompt":"A single, translucent glass pane with a crack running through it labeled 'maybe', reflecting a shadowy figure pressing against the other side."},{"word":"baby","emotion":"manipulative affection masking threat","imageryPrompt":"A glossy, neon-pink phone screen glowing in a dark alleyway displaying only the text 'Baby' while rain soaks the pavement."},{"word":"chase","emotion":"relentless pursuit and loss of agency","imageryPrompt":"Two silhouettes running on a wet asphalt road, one fading into the distance while the other's shadow stretches unnaturally long behind them."},{"word":"phone","emotion":"intrusive connection and digital haunting","imageryPrompt":"A smartphone lying face up on a kitchen counter, its screen lighting up repeatedly in the dim room like an unblinking eye."},{"word":"code","emotion":"violation of privacy and safety breach","imageryPrompt":"A metallic door lock with a digital keypad glowing red, the combination typed in slowly by an unseen hand."},{"word":"missed","emotion":"accumulated neglect and mounting pressure","imageryPrompt":"A stack of forty-seven notification badges piled high on a table, casting long shadows that form the shape of a crowd."},{"word":"laundry","emotion":"intimate details left behind for exploitation","imageryPrompt":"A pile of folded clothes on a counter next to a half-empty plate, mundane objects that now feel like evidence in a crime scene."},{"word":"name","emotion":"identity stripped and weaponized against the singer","imageryPrompt":"The word 'NAME' written repeatedly on fogged glass, each letter slightly different as if carved by a trembling hand."},{"word":"lady","emotion":"rejected title and lost status","imageryPrompt":"An empty chair at a dinner table where the word 'Lady' is written in chalk on the floor, fading into dust."},{"word":"drive","emotion":"controlled movement and territorial encroachment","imageryPrompt":"A car idling outside a window at night, headlights cutting through the darkness to illuminate the singer's shadow on the wall."},{"word":"save","emotion":"desperate need for external intervention","imageryPrompt":"A hand reaching out from a doorway into a dark room, fingers spread wide but unable to grasp the person inside."}]},"tone":{"brightness":3194.8,"dynamicsDb":16.7},"palette":["#080808","#180808","#281808","#080818","#181808"],"boundaries":[60.37,100.77,115.36,120.65,121.95,125.48,130.03,131.98],"sections":[{"name":"Intro","start":0,"end":18.5,"intensity":0.4,"emotion":"anticipation","colorHint":"#3BA3FF"},{"name":"Chorus","start":18.5,"end":39.2,"intensity":0.68,"emotion":"infatuation","colorHint":"#3BA3FF"},{"name":"Verse 1","start":39.2,"end":54.7,"intensity":0.58,"emotion":"amusement","colorHint":"#3BA3FF"},{"name":"Pre-Chorus","start":54.7,"end":59.4,"intensity":0.5,"emotion":"closure","colorHint":"#3BA3FF"},{"name":"Chorus","start":59.4,"end":69.3,"intensity":0.7,"emotion":"swagger","colorHint":"#3BA3FF"},{"name":"Verse 2","start":69.3,"end":84.6,"intensity":0.66,"emotion":"unease","colorHint":"#FFD2B0"},{"name":"The Flip","start":84.6,"end":89.4,"intensity":0.71,"emotion":"reversal","colorHint":"#FFD2B0"},{"name":"Verse 3","start":89.4,"end":99.7,"intensity":0.68,"emotion":"menace","colorHint":"#0E2A47"},{"name":"Bridge","start":99.7,"end":119.4,"intensity":0.55,"emotion":"clarity","colorHint":"#0E2A47"},{"name":"Final Chorus","start":119.4,"end":146.4,"intensity":0.7,"emotion":"panic","colorHint":"#FFD2B0"},{"name":"Outro","start":146.4,"end":150.62,"intensity":0.3,"emotion":"exhaustion","colorHint":"#FFD2B0"}],"stems":[{"name":"drums","fam